OL,3,GNEWSAMan who survived roof fall takes
OL,4,Aon charity challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe managed to learn how to walk again
OL,7,Fand is now walking from King's College
OL,8,FHospital in London to Minnis Bay in
OL,9,FKent in a 24-hour fundraising
OL,10,Fchallenge.
